Package: spss2rmarkdown
Title: Convert SPSS Syntax Files to Reproducible R Markdown Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gilad", "Feldman", email = "giladfel@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2990-8997"))
Description: Converts SPSS .sps syntax files and .sav data files into reproducible
    R Markdown reports. Parses 60+ SPSS commands, translates them to equivalent R
    code using the jmv package, and generates formatted R Markdown documents with
    original SPSS syntax preserved as comments.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/giladfeldman/spss2rmarkdown
BugReports: https://github.com/giladfeldman/spss2rmarkdown/issues
